### Local developer overrides ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# application-local.properties lets a developer override any property without
# touching tracked files.  Spring Boot loads it automatically when it exists.
# Create it with: touch src/main/resources/application-local.properties
application-local.properties
application-*.local.properties
